  sense.

  Below we will use the following notation for each pair of matrix and
  right-hand sides in the batch:

  `matrix`=\\(A \in \Re^{m \times n}\\),
  `rhs`=\\(B  \in \Re^{m \times k}\\),
  `output`=\\(X  \in \Re^{n \times k}\\),
